---
layout: base.njk
title: Ballot Measures
description: Plain-language guides to Ohio Issue 3 and the Conneaut data-center charter amendment, with the effect of YES and NO votes.
permalink: /measures/index.html
---

<section class="directory-page" aria-labelledby="measures-page-title">
  <h1 id="measures-page-title">Ballot measures</h1>
  <p class="directory-intro">These summaries explain what the ballot text would change. They do not recommend how to vote. Check your official sample ballot to see which local questions appear for you.</p>
  <p class="directory-count">{{ measures.length }} statewide and local measure guides</p>
  <div class="directory-grid directory-grid-measures">
    {% for measure in measures %}
      {% set measurePath = '/measures/' + measure.id + '/' %}
      <article class="directory-card">
        <p class="directory-meta">Issue {{ measure.issue_number }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ measurePath | url }}">{{ measure.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ measure.plain_english | truncate(220) }}</p>
        <a class="directory-action" href="{{ measurePath | url }}">Read what YES and NO mean <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <aside class="directory-callout">
    <h2>Sunday liquor questions</h2>
    <p>View the precinct-specific local-option questions and official wording.</p>
    <a class="directory-action" href="{{ '/measures/liquor/' | url }}">Browse liquor issues <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </aside>
</section>